w_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Clearing text causes carets and selection to clear, but its fine to mention them.\r\nOther runtime state is vague and is actually just gutter line data. And text isn't only \"runtime\" state since it can be set beforehand.\r\n\r\nI think we should remove the `full reset` since its not really a full reset. Arguably its not really a reset since text doesn't get reset to what it was originally, it gets cleared.\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t\t\t\tClears all text and related state. This clears the text content, selections, carets, and gutter line data.\r\n```\r\nOr something.","created_at":"2026-08-12T15:03:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T15:18:45Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122318#discussion_r3767624214","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122318","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3767624214"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122318#discussion_r3767624214"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122318"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3767624214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":159,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4018174067","pull_request_review_id":5213233775,"id":4018174067,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7vgHhz","diff_hunk":"@@ -156,7 +156,7 @@\n \t\t<method name=\"clear\">\n \t\t\t<return type=\"void\" />\n \t\t\t<description>\n-\t\t\t\tPerforms a full reset of [TextEdit], including undo history.\n+\t\t\t\tClears all text and related state. This clears the text content, selections, carets, and gutter li